    "title": "历史重构",
    "category": 5,
    "header": "",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·历史重构</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"29e54a893692c887303c58f9fe3151b6\" alt=\"4-1历史重构.png\" title=\"4-1历史重构.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240611/29e54a893692c887303c58f9fe3151b6.png\"/></div><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">通过探险获取分数，转换为</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">散佚迷思</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">，可用于升级</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">历史重构</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中的各项能力。</span></p><p><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在&lt;常规行动&gt;模式中，每累计获得200得分，将获得1点</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">散佚迷思</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">点数，</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">散佚迷思</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">点数可用于点亮</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">加成节点</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></p><p><br/><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">历史重构</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">&lt;五百翻页的笔记&gt;、&lt;三千往返的构筑&gt;、&lt;一万循环的通视&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">节点无需消耗</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">散佚迷思</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">即可解锁，不会影响后续的</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">历史重构</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">节点。这三个节点效果将分别在</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">直面魂灵</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的等级到达</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">3</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">、</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">6</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">、</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">9</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">及以上时生效。</span></p><p><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"> *能力对所有模式都生效，</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">&lt;五百翻页的笔记&gt;、&lt;三千往返的构筑&gt;、&lt;一万循环的通视&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">只对常规模式生效。</span></p>",
    "displayTime": "2024-07-16",
    "sticky": false,
    "updatedAt": 1720507339
  }
}